Early exits from loops (break / continue / return inside a loop): mlir-translate 23.1.5's --deserialize-spirv cannot structurize them ("block has uses outside of the enclosing selection/loop construct"), and mlirbinary reads SPIR-V as it does. Read with structurize: false (--spirv-structurize-control-flow=false) it reads back, as a plain graph of blocks.
